{'symbol': 'NOC', 'date': '2023-06-28 09:30:00', 'title': 'NORTHROP GRUMMAN FIELDS POLISH INTEGRATED BATTLE COMMAND SYSTEM\xa0TRAINING PROGRAM TWO YEARS EARLY', 'text': 'HUNTSVILLE, ALA., JUNE 28, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION (NYSE: NOC) HAS LAUNCHED A TRAINER TO TEACH POLISH SOLDIERS HOW TO USE THE INTEGRATED BATTLE COMMAND SYSTEM (IBCS). THE SYSTEM, DELIVERED TWO YEARS AHEAD OF SCHEDULE, WILL ENABLE POLAND TO QUICKLY FIELD THE TRANSFORMATIONAL INTEGRATED COMMAND AND CONTROL CAPABILITIES OF IBCS. POLAND IS THE FIRST U.S. ALLY TO FIELD IBCS.'}